@host = http://localhost:5080

### Сеть: список устройств
GET {{host}}/api/devices

### Сеть: свет
POST {{host}}/api/light
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceIndex": 0,
  "lightControllerSource": "On",
  "channels": [1, 2, 3, 4],
  "brightness": [200, 200, 200, 200]
}

### COM: список (порты из appsettings или query)
GET {{host}}/api/com/devices?ports=COM1,COM3

### COM: свет по порту
POST {{host}}/api/com/light?ports=COM1,COM3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comPort": "COM1",
  "lightControllerSource": "On",
  "channels": [1, 2, 3, 4],
  "brightness": [255, 128, 80, 50]
}

### COM: прямой fallback (если /api/com/devices пуст)
### Яркость: для MvIO см. appsettings IoController:BrightnessMapping.
### Scale255To100 — 10 из тела ≈ 4% на контроллере; для проверки шлите 255 или режим Percent.
POST {{host}}/api/com/light
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comPort": "COM1",
  "lightControllerSource": "On",
  "channels": [1, 2, 3, 4],
  "brightness": [100, 100, 100, 100]
}
